title: Climate Transition on track!
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: climate_transition_matures_trigger and climate_transition_points > 5
max-visits: 1
role: event
on-arrival: {!
    G.deactivateLaw(Q, "climate_transition_core_initial", undefined, true);
    G.deactivateLaw(Q, "climate_binding_targets_initial", undefined, true);
    G.registerLaw(Q, {id:"climate_transition_core_mature",colour:"green",description:"Beyond an initial investment, and targets for emissions reductions, strides have been made to reduce GHG emissions and transform the economy",title:"Mature Climate Transition",icon:"img/leaf_icon.svg",targets:{gdp_growth:0.01,generalitat_surplus:-0.01,unemployment_recovery:0.02,welfare_index_growth:0.05}});
    if (!Q.climate_transition_contested_struck) {
        G.registerLaw(Q, {id:"climate_binding_targets_mature",colour:"green",description:"Binding targets on GHG emissions have been set for operations happening in Catalonia.",title:"Binding Climate Targets",icon:"img/leaf_icon.svg",targets:{gdp_growth:0.02,generalitat_surplus:-0.01,unemployment_recovery:0.005,welfare_index_growth:0.02}});
    }
    // TODO: check number of climate_transition_points required
!}

= Climate Transition on track!

After the initial phases of sanctions, heavy investment and divestment, and arduous work, it seems that we're starting to see its first fruits. New industrial investment is already following the new regulations, and we're gradually seeing a moving away from the most polluting practices. The road ahead is still complex and this is far from addressing all the issues related to climate change, but it is definitely a start!

- @post_event: Great!
